  "id": "hot-dog-relish",
  "name": "Hot Dog Relish",
  "subtitle": "Tangy chopped vegetable relish with mustard seed",
  "description": "A sweet-tart relish made from chopped green vegetables, cabbage, vinegar, and warm spices. Chill before serving and refrigerate leftovers.",
